 "description": "Read one Reddit thread using configured approved OAuth access, preserving Markdown and reply identity under an output budget. Unavailable until credentials are configured. PAID: 3000 micro-dollar service credits per successful call. First use agent_utilities_prepare for this tool. Requires existing credits and a private Authorization header. Reuse prepared arguments for recovery; a new requestId is a new billable operation.",
